Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.91,2:05:11.23,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑豹》
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.52,2:05:15.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联合国 奥地利 维也纳）
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.65,2:14:22.36,Title,0,0,0,0,,黑豹将在《复仇者联盟3：无限战争》中回归
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baba…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我讲个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me a story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,家乡的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story of home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,数百万年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of years ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗振金陨星\N{\fnArial\fs30}A meteorite made of vibranium…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是全宇宙最强大的物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strongest substance in the universe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,落在了非洲大陆上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Struck the continent of Africa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它改变了附近的植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affecting the plant life around it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当人类时代到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the time of man came…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个部落定居于此 并称之为瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five tribes settled on it and called it Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个部落总在彼此争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tribes lived in constant war with each other…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到一位萨满战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until a warrior shaman…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.27,0:00:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过黑豹女神芭丝特看到幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Received a vision from the panther goddess bast…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,并在她的指引下找到心形草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who led him to the heart-shaped herb…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那株植物赋予了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}A plant that granted him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人的力量 速度和直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}superhuman strength, speed and instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那名战士成为了国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The warrior became king…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是第一代黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the first black panther…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达的保护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The protector of Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个部落同意听从国王的统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four tribes agreed to live under the king's rule…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但贾巴里部落却自己隐于山中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Jabari tribe isolated themselves in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达人用振金发展了科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wakandans used vibranium to develop technology…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,先进程度超过其他任何国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}More advanced than any other nation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但瓦坎达兴盛时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as Wakanda thrived…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它周边的世界却进一步陷入混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world around it descended further into chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep vibranium safe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达人决意隐藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wakandans vowed to hide in plain sight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对外界世界隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping the truth of their power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真实的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the outside world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在隐藏吗 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we still hide, Baba?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.82,0:01:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走运罢了 - 才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucky shot! - That aingt lucky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:01:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever! Get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.03,0:01:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻啊 他没人守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick your man up! He open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.05,0:02:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,传球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass! Pass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got you, es. - Es, hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch me get this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂姆·哈达威的范儿 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim Hardaway style. That's what I call it, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮亮本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么本事都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aingt got nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.85,0:02:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果我们快进快出 就不会有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if we get in and out quick, won't be no worries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车 从西侧进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in the van, come in through from the west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕过拐角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come around the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和双胞胎停在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and the twins are pulling up right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这辆车留下 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving this car behind, okay? We come this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西藏好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide the straps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, is it the feds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,俩活像超模的小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's these two Grace Jones-looking chicks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还握着矛\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're holding spears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会再敲第二次的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't knock again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼乔布王子 阿祖里之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince N'Jobu, son of Azzuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我证明你是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove to me you are one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢把性命交给他 让他留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust him with my life. He stays…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你允许 特查卡国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your permission, king T'Chaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如你所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,起身\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, baby brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你过得好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see how you are holding up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去很强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭丝特保佑 我很健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glory to bast, I am in good health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,家乡如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.43,0:04:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭遇了袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been an attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤利西斯·克劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulysses Klaue…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.79,0:04:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们这里偷走了0.25吨的振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stole a quarter ton of vibranium from us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了逃跑 还在边境引爆了炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And triggered a bomb at the border to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,害死了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many lives were lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很清楚我们把振金藏在了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew where we hid the vibranium…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也知道该如何袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how to strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有内应\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had someone on the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我要你看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I want you to look me in the eyes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你为什么要背叛瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell me why you betrayed Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖厉 巴度之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zuri, son of Badu…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}James. James, you lied to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.77,0:05:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本就是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were Wakandan this whole time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你背叛了瓦坎达 - 你怎么能这样骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You betrayed Wakanda! - How could you lie to me like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是唯一被派来的探子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think that you were the only spy we sent here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼乔布王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince N'Jobu…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要马上回国\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will return home at once…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,并面见议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you will face the council…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他们坦白你的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And inform them of your crimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,守好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard your man, guard your man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.23,0:06:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小国瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The tiny nation of Wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在哀悼他们的特查卡国王之死\N{\fnArial\fs30}is mourning the death of its monarch, king T'Chaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位挚爱的领袖是众多死难者之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beloved ruler was one of many confirmed dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们皆死于一周前的联合国恐袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a terrorist attack at the united nations a week ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌犯已被逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The suspect has since been apprehended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达仍是全球最贫困的国家之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though it remains one of the poorest countries in the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,山脉是它的天然壁垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortified by mountain ranges…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,热带雨林铸就了不可穿越的屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an impenetrable rainforest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该国不与外界进行国际贸易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda does not engage in international trade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不接受援助\N{\fnArial\fs30}or accept aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,继承王位的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The succession of the throne…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,将是国王两个孩子中的长子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is expected to fall to the oldest of the king's two children…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince T'Challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My prince…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接近他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up on them now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必 奥克耶 我自己来就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need, Okoye. I can handle this alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽快救娜吉雅出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will get Nakia out as quickly as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到她时可别僵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't freeze when you see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会僵住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never freeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.77,0:08:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,车熄火了 还打不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the car. It lost power. It won't start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,车打不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car no start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎熄火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The engine failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ours, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遇袭了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we under attack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get around to the side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense positions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}No games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.97,0:09:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,回复 回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边 注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there! Look back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's just a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是被绑架来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got kidnapped as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞄着她呢 别动 不然我开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have her! Don't move! I will shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会打死她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shoot her right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你僵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You froze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干什么 你破坏了我的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here? You've ruined my mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲死了 娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father is dead, Nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天要加冕为王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be crowned king tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能到场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish for you to be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry yourselves home now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上那男孩 送他回族人那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take the boy. Get him to his people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们绝不能提起今天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will speak nothing of this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.19,0:12:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Nakia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My prince…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么看都不腻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This never gets old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:13:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen mother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}My comfort for your loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你又回到了我们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is so good to have you back with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去河部落 为仪式做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the river province to prepare her for the ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他僵住了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he freeze?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像车前灯下的羚羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an antelope in headlights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,闹够了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you finished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹居然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So surprised my little sister came{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大日子前来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see me off before our big day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为电磁脉冲珠来的 我做了升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for the emp beads. I've developed an update.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,升级 不 这个挺好使的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Update? No. It worked perfectly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.85,0:14:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要教你多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to teach you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because something works{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也总还有改进的空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean that it cannot be improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教我 你知道什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are teaching me? What do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你知道得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及看你怎么升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to see what kind of update you make{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的礼服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your ceremonial outfit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天感觉怎么样 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling today, mama?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲和我经常谈论这一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father and I would talk about this day all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他与我们同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is with us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该成为国王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is your time to be king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是来看看这些文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just checking out these artifacts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你是位专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell me you're the expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's this one from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,波波阿尚蒂部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bobo ashanti tribe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在如今的加纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present day Ghana…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是19世纪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}19th century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.21,0:15:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.14,0:16:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个贝宁伊多人的文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's from the Edo people of Benin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,16世纪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}16th century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,再跟我说说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me about this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是贝宁的 7世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also from Benin, seventh century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.59,0:16:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗拉部落吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fula tribe, I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.45,0:16:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.65,0:16:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是贝宁的英军劫走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was taken by British soldiers in Benin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它原本来自瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's from Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是用振金制造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's made out of vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我会把它带走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't trip. I'm gonna take it off your hands for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些文物是不出售的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These items aren't for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.03,0:16:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你的祖先是怎么得到它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think your ancestors got these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们是付了公道的价钱买下的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they paid a fair price?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是他们夺走的 就像其他一切他们夺走的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did they take it, like they took everything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我得请你离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I'm going to have to ask you to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多的保安 从我走进来就一直盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got all this security in here watching me ever since I walked in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却没注意自己喝下了什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you aingt checking for what you put in your body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.73,0:16:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 哥们 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, mate. Let's have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, mate. Time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.99,0:16:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好像不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she might not be feeling too good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody get some help! Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫个医生 拜托 谁救救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call a doctor, please! Please, somebody, come help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.99,0:17:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,急需医疗救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical emergency right away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往西非展厅 速来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the west African exhibit, please, right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.39,0:17:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,请退后 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back, please. Step back. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 医务人员 借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through over there. Medics coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她点空间 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's give the lady some space, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back, please, gents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,请退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走 但别告诉任何人 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go, but just don't tell anyone, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.49,0:17:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你怎么不直接打死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, why you aingt just shoot him right here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为让犯罪现场分散开一点会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's better to leave the crime scene more spread out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们显得业余\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes us look like amateurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你说得对不对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's see if you know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,小试牛刀而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just a taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要发财了 - 你最好赶紧出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna be a rich boy. - You better sell that quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经出手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already sold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你想做什么 瓦坎达人会找上门来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you try, the Wakandans will probably show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那最好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll make my day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以一石二鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can kill two birds with one stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说那也是振金吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not telling me that's vibranium, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我就是挺喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'm just feeling it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.65,0:19:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.47,0:20:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 祖厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, Zuri…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴度之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of Badu…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.51,0:20:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你们请出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give to you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince T'Challa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prince…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在将被剥去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will now have the strength of the black panther{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑豹的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripped away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,先祖保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,先祖保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式格斗的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory in ritual combat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:22:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,由投降或战死决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comes by yield or death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.37,0:22:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有哪个部落要举荐战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any tribe wishes to put forth a warrior{\r}
