Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,矿部落今日不挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mining tribe will not challenge today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.89,0:22:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否有王室血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any member of a royal blood{\r}
