Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.79,0:22:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件束身衣好不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}This corset is really uncomfortable…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能赶紧完事回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So could we all just wrap it up and go home?{\r}
