Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是贾巴里的人吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are they Jabari? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,姆巴库 你来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}M'Baku, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是挑战日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's challenge day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.71,0:23:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have watched…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.05,0:23:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山里观察 倾听\N{\fnArial\fs30}And listened from the mountains!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们厌恶地看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have watched with disgust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把科技发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your technological advancements{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.47,0:23:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been overseen by a child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.32,0:23:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还嘲笑我们的传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who scoffs at tradition!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.43,0:24:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你们又想把国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you want to hand the nation{\r}
