Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.13,0:24:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至不能保护自己的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could not keep his own father safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.45,0:24:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.37,0:24:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, we will not have it, oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.70,0:24:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 姆巴库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, M'Baku…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.55,0:24:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴里部落的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leader of the Jabari…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.39,0:24:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受你的挑战 姆巴库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept your challenge, M'Baku.{\r}
