Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.83,0:24:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,女子皇家护卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dora Milaje!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.52,0:24:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.42,0:25:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the challenge begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.95,0:25:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up!{\r}
