Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.80,0:25:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.26,0:25:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的神呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your god now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.08,0:26:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.07,0:26:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有爪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No claws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.25,0:26:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有战服\N{\fnArial\fs30}No special suit, oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.46,0:26:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个不配做领袖的小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a boy not fit to lead!{\r}
