Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.25,0:26:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是特查拉王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am prince T'Challa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.22,0:26:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查卡国王之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of king T'Chaka!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this, T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.31,0:27:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.80,0:27:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.89,0:27:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降 别逼我杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yield! Don't make me kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.29,0:27:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.49,0:27:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.52,0:27:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.69,0:27:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.76,0:27:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.36,0:27:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打得光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have fought with honor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.57,0:27:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧 你的人还需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now yield! Your people need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.91,0:27:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yield, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.16,0:27:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.19,0:27:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.46,0:27:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.63,0:27:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now present to you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.40,0:28:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}king T'Challa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.62,0:28:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.32,0:28:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.38,0:28:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.44,0:28:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.99,0:28:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.47,0:29:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让心形草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow the heart-shaped herb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.43,0:29:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复黑豹神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to restore the powers of the black panther{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.45,0:29:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并带你进入先祖之域\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take you to the ancestral plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.23,0:29:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Chaka…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们呼唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.44,0:29:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来见你儿子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here to your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.91,0:29:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,先祖保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.12,0:31:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.30,0:31:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.03,0:31:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.81,0:31:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.01,0:31:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是国王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.76,0:31:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong, my son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.16,0:31:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.32,0:31:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不是这辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you not prepared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.87,0:31:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在为做国王做准备吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be king your whole life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.48,0:31:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你没有一直在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you not trained and studied, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.02,0:31:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习训练吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}been by my side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.06,0:32:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指的不是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not what I am talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.30,0:32:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没准备好与你分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not ready to be without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.73,0:32:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有让孩子准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who has not prepared his children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.64,0:32:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对他死亡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his own death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.51,0:32:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个失败的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}has failed as a father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.79,0:32:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我辜负过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I ever failed you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.06,0:32:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.42,0:32:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎样最能保护瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how to best protect Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.02,0:32:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做个好国王 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be a great king, Baba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.93,0:32:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像您那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.02,0:32:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会面临困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to struggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.92,0:32:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要让身边 有值得信赖的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll need to surround yourself with people you trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.97,0:32:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人 有善良的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man with a good heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.26,0:32:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好人是很难当好国王的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's hard for a good man to be king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.23,0:32:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa, breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.93,0:33:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.29,0:33:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.49,0:33:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到他了 我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there. My father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.76,0:33:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.27,0:33:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧 娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come home, Nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.35,0:33:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.39,0:33:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to support you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,并缅怀你父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to honor your father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.49,0:33:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.88,0:33:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在外面世界里找到了自己的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, I found my calling out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.54,0:33:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到了太多贫困的人 不能再视而不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen too many in need just to turn a blind eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里开心不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be happy here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.41,0:33:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道外面世界里还有一无所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing that there's people out there who have nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.84,0:34:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你希望瓦坎达做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have Wakanda do about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.10,0:34:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,分享我们的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Share what we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.07,0:34:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以提供援助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could provide aid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.56,0:34:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,分享技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}and access to technology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.88,0:34:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,庇护难民\N{\fnArial\fs30}and refuge to those who need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.43,0:34:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他国家也这么做 我们能做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other countries do it, we could do it better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟其他国家不一样 娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not like these other countries, Nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.23,0:34:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果世界得知了我们真正的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the world found out what we truly are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.36,0:34:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拥有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we possess, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.99,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会失去现在的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could lose our way of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.74,0:34:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达有足够的力量帮助他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda is strong enough to help others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.98,0:34:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,并保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}and protect ourselves at the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.85,0:34:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不是这么固执 本可以当个好王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were not so stubborn, you would make a great queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.92,0:34:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为我固执 我才能当个好王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would make a great queen because I am so stubborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.70,0:34:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 承认了吧 - 如果我想当王后的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See, you admit it! - If that's what I wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.37,0:34:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.04,0:34:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭丝特保佑 它还在长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glory to Bast, man. Is he still growing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.17,0:34:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.43,0:34:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see Nakia is back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.06,0:34:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要再续前缘吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys going to work it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.68,0:35:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.38,0:35:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.50,0:35:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅觉得我们该多做一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia thinks we should be doing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.77,0:35:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么多做\N{\fnArial\fs30}More, like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.82,0:35:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,援助他国 难民计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foreign aid, refugee programs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.38,0:35:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放难民进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let the refugees in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.78,0:35:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只会带来他们的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bring their problems with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.96,0:35:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时瓦坎达就会像其他地方一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Wakanda is like everywhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.22,0:35:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要我和我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you said you wanted me and my men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,去清扫外面的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go out there and clean up the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.69,0:35:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'll be all for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.70,0:35:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们从不会向他国宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}But waging war on other countries has never been our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.03,0:35:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.19,0:35:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭丝特保佑 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bast! We're in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.04,0:35:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.26,0:35:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.31,0:35:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们绝对猜不到我们刚发现了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never guess who just popped up on our radar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.74,0:35:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件未能被认出的瓦坎达文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A misidentified Wakandan artifact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.33,0:36:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨日被从大不列颠博物馆盗走\N{\fnArial\fs30}was stolen yesterday from a British museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.36,0:36:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得知 尤利西斯·克劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have learned Ulysses Klaue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.61,0:36:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算于明晚在韩国将振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}plans to sell the vibranium to an American buyer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.80,0:36:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,出售给美国买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}in South Korea tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.92,0:36:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳已经潜逃近30年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaue has escaped our pursuits for almost 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.88,0:36:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,未能逮捕他 或许是我父亲最大的遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not capturing him is, perhaps, my father's greatest regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.74,0:36:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把克劳抓回来接受审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to bring Klaue back here to stand trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.80,0:36:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达现在需要的不是一名战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda does not need a warrior right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.04,0:36:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一名国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.26,0:36:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母在他的袭击中丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents were killed when he attacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.86,0:36:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每一天都深深铭记着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a day goes by when I do not think about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.95,0:36:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳让我们失去了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what Klaue took from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.61,0:36:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我失去了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}From me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.76,0:36:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个机会太好 不容错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too great an opportunity to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.54,0:36:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我一起去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.61,0:36:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以联手拿下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take him down together, side by side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.05,0:36:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你留下保护边境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you here protecting the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.25,0:36:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I ask, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.68,0:36:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么将他就地正法\N{\fnArial\fs30}you kill him where he stands, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.99,0:36:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么把他带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you bring him back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.83,0:36:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.11,0:37:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带他回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will bring him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.75,0:37:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将执行这项任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will proceed with the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.98,0:37:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.97,0:37:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.31,0:38:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经为你送了辆车去釜山\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already sent a car ahead to Busan for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.49,0:38:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要带谁跟你去韩国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you taking with you to Korea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.78,0:38:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.54,0:38:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Nakia as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.32,0:38:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定带你前任去执行任务是个好主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure it's a good idea to take your ex on a mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.56,0:38:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.81,0:38:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.67,0:38:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 如果需要支援 我们还能联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you'll be on call should we need backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.94,0:38:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.31,0:38:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有好东西给你看 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have great things to show you, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.83,0:38:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你要在韩国用的通讯设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are your communication devices for Korea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不限距连线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlimited range, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还配有音频监控系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}also equipped with audio surveillance system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.92,0:38:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check these out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.53,0:38:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,遥控灵珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remote access kimoyo beads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.68,0:38:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,升级过 可以直接与我的沙台连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Updated to interface directly with my sand table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.22,0:38:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.24,0:38:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的问题是 你穿的是啥玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real question is what are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.97,0:38:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在我的实验室里露脚指头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have your toes out in my lab?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.95,0:38:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你不喜欢我的王室拖鞋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you don't like my royal sandals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.27,0:38:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一天登基 想打扮复古点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to go old school for my first day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.84,0:38:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,长老们肯定可喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet the elders loved that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.12,0:38:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try them on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.52,0:39:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,全自动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fully automated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.01,0:39:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像爸爸以前看的那些美国老电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the old American movie Baba used to watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.08,0:39:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还把它们做成了绝对吸音的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I made them completely sound absorbent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.84,0:39:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.88,0:39:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜我怎么称呼它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what I call them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.91,0:39:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜行鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sneakers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.93,0:39:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,双关了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.25,0:39:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.45,0:39:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要去对付克劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're going to take on Klaue, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.42,0:39:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会需要设计部能拿出的最好作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll need the best the design group has to offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.89,0:39:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,A展品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exhibit a.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.17,0:39:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的设计 - 老技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My design. - Old tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.01,0:39:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老 - 可用 但老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Old? - Functional, but old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.39,0:39:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人冲我开枪诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, people are shooting at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.99,0:39:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我戴上头盔先\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wait, let me put on my helmet."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.14,0:39:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.89,0:39:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look at these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.37,0:39:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like that one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.90,0:39:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺诱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tempting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.01,0:39:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想引人注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the idea is to not be noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.67,0:39:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.21,0:40:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫它启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tell it to go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.39,0:40:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,整套战服都在项链坠里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire suit sits within the teeth of the necklace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.55,0:40:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,打一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.70,0:40:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便打吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.77,0:40:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么用力啊 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that hard, genius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.47,0:40:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我打的 你又没说多使劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me to strike it. You didn't say how hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.89,0:40:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请你来我的实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invite you to my lab, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.30,0:40:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就乱踢乱打吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you just kick things around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.89,0:40:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该把它造结实点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you should make it a little stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.73,0:40:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.41,0:40:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳米材料能吸收动能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nanites absorb the kinetic energy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.05,0:40:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,并锁定它 以待重新分配\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hold it in place for redistribution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.16,0:40:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再打一下同一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike it again in the same spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.87,0:40:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在录像吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're recording?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.95,0:40:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了日后研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}For research purposes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.11,0:40:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把视频给我删了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delete that footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.72,0:41:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.88,0:41:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bast willing, this will go quickly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.61,0:41:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也能拿掉脑袋上这荒唐的玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can get this ridiculous thing off my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.06,0:41:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好看的 前后甩甩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks nice. Just whip it back and forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.22,0:41:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 真丢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It's a disgrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.76,0:41:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 索菲娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sophia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.67,0:41:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.24,0:41:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他俩是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.00,0:41:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯尼亚的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends from Kenya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.30,0:41:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大金主 他们没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very deep pockets. They're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.07,0:41:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「没问题」的麻烦精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for trouble…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.77,0:41:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.11,0:42:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.54,0:42:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.98,0:42:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,买家八成已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The buyer is likely already here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.15,0:42:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面那女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.63,0:42:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的「麻烦」什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What trouble was she referring to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.07,0:42:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟一些象牙贩子起了点争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got into a disagreement with some ivory traders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.10,0:42:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,闹得有点大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made a bit of a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.20,0:43:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那今晚还会有什么麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will there be any trouble tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.27,0:43:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼亚女继承人小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Kenyan heiress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.45,0:43:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.76,0:43:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看你能多快完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}On how quickly we finish the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.12,0:43:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能专心点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we please focus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.79,0:43:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.18,0:43:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.19,0:43:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请来杯威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}One whiskey, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.85,0:43:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes up. Americans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.38,0:43:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.68,0:43:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.95,0:43:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能没看到你身后那俩油亮的背头\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you miss greased lightning there behind you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.78,0:43:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.98,0:43:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了一位中情局的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just spotted an old friend who works for the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.69,0:43:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下情况复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just got a little more complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.66,0:43:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.89,0:43:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.53,0:43:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是克劳的买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are buying from Klaue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.03,0:43:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm doing or not doing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.72,0:44:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是代表美国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}on behalf of the U.S. government{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.42,0:44:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}is none of your concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.86,0:44:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, whatever the hell you're up to, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.58,0:44:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙 别来妨碍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}do me a favor, stay out of my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.93,0:44:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把泽莫交给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you Zemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.27,0:44:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不是替你保守了秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I keep it under wraps, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.65,0:44:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没让人知道一位第三世界国家的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the king of a third world country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.47,0:44:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着一身防弹猫咪战服满街跑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}runs around in a bulletproof cat suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.58,0:44:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say we were even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.01,0:44:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真得马上走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really need to leave, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.51,0:44:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳要跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaue is leaving out that door with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.03,0:44:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been warned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.48,0:44:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 双骰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, craps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.09,0:44:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.98,0:44:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.47,0:44:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll just take these, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.63,0:44:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring them over here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.31,0:44:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,替他保管一下好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hold on for safekeeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.25,0:44:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 瓦坎达国王来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, heads up. The king of Wakanda is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.71,0:44:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让他带走克劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot leave with Klaue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.05,0:44:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.86,0:44:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,索科威亚袭击事件中的振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium from the attack on Sokovia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.63,0:44:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,被查到了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}links back to a person{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.71,0:44:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我要来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'm not actually saying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.00,0:44:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了跟他交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to make a deal with, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.31,0:44:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次交易不会被取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that deal will not be called off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.57,0:44:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等事情告一段落\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the dust settles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.83,0:44:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以谈个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and me can work something out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.54,0:45:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来交易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to make a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.46,0:45:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳 带了八个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaue, plus eight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.74,0:45:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.77,0:45:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就位 可以守住出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}In position to secure our exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.99,0:45:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,振金呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the vibranium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.01,0:45:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.95,0:45:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不是不许带武器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought there were no weapons allowed in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.75,0:45:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,按理说是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not supposed to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.51,0:45:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人可能不知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody did not get the memo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.85,0:45:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.78,0:45:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好有架势的随从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is quite the entourage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.25,0:45:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要发新专了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a mix-tape coming out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.51,0:45:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 还真有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Yeah, actually, there is one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.33,0:45:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢 我可以把链接发你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send you the soundcloud link, if you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.52,0:45:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴夫 你能把音乐链接发给他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dave, can you get the link to the tape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.89,0:45:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别逼我听你的曲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't make me listen to your music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.70,0:45:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说 你带了好多人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just meant you got a lot of people with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.96,0:46:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他们是为你准备的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.22,0:46:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.28,0:46:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以自己跟你完成交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do a deal with you all by myself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.46,0:46:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.00,0:46:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了六个 这是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six more. It's a setup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.48,0:46:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿钻石来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the diamonds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.56,0:46:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别捏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.54,0:46:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得去拿下克劳 - 别妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to move on Klaue. - Stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.08,0:46:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能引起枪战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't afford a shootout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.08,0:46:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,振金呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.43,0:46:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想买个高档的公文箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to buy a fancy suitcase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.74,0:46:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是决定省省钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought I'd save myself some money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.68,0:46:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不动手就没机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's now or never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.38,0:46:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.41,0:46:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.92,0:47:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达人 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakandans! They're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.47,0:47:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 杀光他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get outta here! - Kill 'em all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.62,0:47:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去拿钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamonds, quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.87,0:48:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murderer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.88,0:48:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.50,0:48:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你老子真像\N{\fnArial\fs30}you look just like your old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.45,0:48:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撒钱雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.10,0:48:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here, boss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.49,0:48:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,太爽了 太爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was awesome! That was awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.57,0:48:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 开车 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Go, go, go, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.01,0:48:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们丢下他吗 - 他会追上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we just leave him? - He'll catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.64,0:48:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.38,0:48:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.65,0:49:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,遥控驾驶系统已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remote driving system activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.73,0:49:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这是左驾还是右驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Which side of the road is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.76,0:49:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在芭丝特的分上 开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Bast's sake! Just drive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.44,0:49:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, calm down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.23,0:49:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.53,0:49:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放点音乐 你当这是送葬啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put some music on. What do you think this is, a funeral?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.46,0:49:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪辆是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one is he in now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.92,0:49:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, split up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.86,0:49:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们想甩掉我们 - 我追右边那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're trying to lose us. - I'll take the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.92,0:49:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追另两个 我看到条近路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take the other two! I see a shortcut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.70,0:49:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过不去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.48,0:49:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.89,0:50:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.36,0:50:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.35,0:50:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想了 你棒棒哒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it. You're doing great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.28,0:50:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.61,0:50:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真原始\N{\fnArial\fs30}So primitive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.79,0:50:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是振金车 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a vibranium car, you idiots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.04,0:50:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹打不透的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullets won't penetrate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.51,0:50:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.54,0:50:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,开你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.03,0:50:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.29,0:51:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的战服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at your suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.96,0:51:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挨了好多子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been taking bullets, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.15,0:51:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,战服积蓄了不少动能\N{\fnArial\fs30}charging it up with kinetic energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.03,0:51:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕到卡车另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull around the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.08,0:51:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.71,0:51:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭显摆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show-off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.17,0:51:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.64,0:51:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.44,0:51:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们玩玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's have some fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.06,0:52:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.51,0:52:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把矛放后备箱里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that spear in the trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.17,0:52:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,再快点 苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, Shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.21,0:52:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经开到最快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going as fast as I can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.66,0:52:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转 右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a right! Take a right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.47,0:52:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.36,0:52:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.60,0:53:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.49,0:53:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我们会忘记吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think we would forget?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.55,0:53:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, murderer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.38,0:53:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这武器你从哪弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this weapon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.21,0:53:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些野蛮人不配拥有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You savages didn't deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.09,0:53:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶命啊 陛下 饶命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, mercy, king. Mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.79,0:53:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喘的每一口气都是我仁慈的体现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every breath you take is mercy from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.16,0:53:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}King!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.03,0:53:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界在看着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world watches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.10,0:53:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 几位 我们快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Guys. Let's go, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.24,0:53:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.55,0:54:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.65,0:54:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得到你们 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you! I can. I can see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.78,0:54:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是闹得好大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is a big mess, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.70,0:54:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不如唱红脸白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured we could go good cop, bad cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.14,0:54:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先进去跟他谈 然后你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk to him first, then you guys go in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.46,0:54:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让他单独跟克劳谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let him talk to Klaue alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.18,0:54:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好让他单独跟克劳谈5分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better to let him talk to Klaue alone for 5 minutes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.23,0:54:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在这里闹不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to make a scene here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.37,0:54:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你审问过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}After your questioning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.45,0:54:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要带他回瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will take him back to Wakanda with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.53,0:54:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.36,0:54:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I like you, a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.68,0:54:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他已经被我缉拿 他哪里都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's in my custody now. He's not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.59,0:54:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我光是允许你们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm doing you guys a favor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.18,0:54:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是给你们面子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by letting you even be in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.18,0:54:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他再敢碰你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he touches you again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.80,0:54:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把他插在那个桌子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to impale him to this desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.67,0:54:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会说英语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she speak english?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.41,0:55:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想说就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she wants to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.93,0:55:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.95,0:55:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我问完了 你们再上\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm done, you guys are up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.60,0:55:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗斯特工 - 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agent Ross. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.88,0:55:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感谢你在釜山的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do appreciate your help in Busan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.33,0:55:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.05,0:55:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫外交\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called diplomacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.51,0:55:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.70,0:55:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.74,0:55:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,客气点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.97,0:55:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Americans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.27,0:55:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt me no more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.88,0:55:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.48,0:55:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 别再伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, don't hurt me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.86,0:55:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt me no more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.22,0:55:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该相信那些瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you really shouldn't trust the Wakandans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.30,0:55:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你才是一类人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm much more your speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.75,0:55:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干这行 谁都不信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust anybody, not in this job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.76,0:55:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我对外面那个手臂炮感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I am interested in is that arm cannon out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.59,0:55:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.44,0:55:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是被我调试过的旧采矿工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an old mining tool that I made some adjustments to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.56,0:55:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你要 我可以给你弄一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can get you one, if you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.84,0:55:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不说出你供货商的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you give me the name of your supplier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.85,0:55:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我直接去找他们要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll ask them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.17,0:55:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.79,0:55:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己去问他好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you ask him yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.60,0:55:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 特查拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? T'Challa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.34,0:56:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你手臂上的武器是瓦坎达来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me that weapon on your arm is from Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.14,0:56:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.03,0:56:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对瓦坎达究竟有什么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you actually know about Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.71,0:56:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,牧羊 纺织 衣服很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shepherds, textiles, cool outfits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.90,0:56:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是幌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.76,0:56:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,探索者找了那里几个世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explorers searched for it for centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.41,0:56:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的黄金城\N{\fnArial\fs30}El dorado, the golden city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.30,0:56:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为是在南美洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought they could find it in South America, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.48,0:56:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实本就是在非洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was in Africa the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.80,0:56:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个科技奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A technological marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.78,0:56:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为这个国家脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because it was built{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.37,0:56:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是世上最珍惜的金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a mound of the most valuable metal known to man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.54,0:56:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们称之为「天赐」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isipho, they call it. The gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.18,0:56:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.37,0:56:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,振金 嗯 地球上最坚硬的金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium, yeah, strongest metal on earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.75,0:56:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just a metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.10,0:56:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把它缝进衣服里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sew it into their clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.49,0:56:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它为城市供能 开发科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}It powers their city, their tech, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.84,0:56:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}their weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.89,0:56:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.75,0:56:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.68,0:56:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手臂炮相比之下就像吹叶机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes my arm cannon look like a leaf blower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.59,0:56:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个美丽的童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a nice fairy tale, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.92,0:56:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但瓦坎达是个第三世界国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Wakanda is a third world country, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.95,0:56:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你把他们的振金都偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you stole all their vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.84,0:56:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.44,0:57:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.92,0:57:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿的不过九牛一毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a tiny piece of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.85,0:57:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还有整整一山的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a mountain full of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.53,0:57:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经开采了数千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been mining it for thousands of years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.91,0:57:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,却还只是触及了矿藏的表层\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they still haven't scratched the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.32,0:57:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唯一见到了真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only outsider who's seen it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.40,0:57:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着出来的外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got out of there alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.45,0:57:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't believe me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.53,0:57:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去问问你的朋友 他的战服是什么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ask your friend what his suit is made of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.53,0:57:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的爪子是什么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What his claws are made of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.95,0:57:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲对联合国说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father told the UN{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.06,0:57:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳盗走了你们全部的振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Klaue stole all the vibranium you had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.61,0:57:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在他却说你们还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now he's telling me you have more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.80,0:57:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you believe the word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.10,0:58:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,捆在椅子上的军火贩的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of an arms dealer strapped to a chair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.29,0:58:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.69,0:58:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.26,0:58:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还藏了多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much more are you hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.19,0:58:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is happening out back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.11,0:58:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.28,0:58:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.58,0:58:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.79,0:58:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,手雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.06,0:59:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还真是不紧不慢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you took your time, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.21,0:59:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.48,0:59:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.15,0:59:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.11,0:59:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替我挡了子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just jumped in front of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.96,0:59:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里是治不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he'll make it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.39,0:59:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹击中了脊椎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hit his spine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.54,0:59:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一颗灵珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a kimoyo bead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.28,0:59:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能暂时稳定他的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will stabilize him for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.48,1:00:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.87,1:00:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.36,1:00:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务是抓克劳回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mission was to bring back Klaue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.84,1:00:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.78,1:00:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人还是外国情报人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man is a foreign intelligence operative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.79,1:00:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要如何解释带他进入国境内\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we justify bringing him into our borders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.20,1:00:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替我挡了子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took a bullet for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.90,1:00:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was his choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.33,1:00:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就要任由他死去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we are just supposed to let him die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.23,1:00:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 如果我们治好了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us consider that we heal him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.08,1:00:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有责任向他的国家汇报情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is his duty to report back to his country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.63,1:00:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为国王 你则有责任保护我们国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as king, it is your duty to protect ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.02,1:00:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚我的职责 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm well aware of my duties, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.97,1:00:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能任他死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot just let him die, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.91,1:00:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们明明能救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing we can save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.38,1:00:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们究竟要带他去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where exactly are we taking him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.44,1:01:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 又带来个受伤的白人让我们治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! Another broken white boy for us to fix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.59,1:01:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会很好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is going to be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.47,1:01:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.96,1:01:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦卡比来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}W'Kabi is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.51,1:01:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 兄弟 克劳呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, brother? Where is Klaue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.58,1:01:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.02,1:01:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从我们掌心里溜走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slipped through our hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.73,1:01:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「溜走了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Slipped"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.92,1:01:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲掌权30年 什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 30 years, your father was in power and did nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.86,1:01:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会有所不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you, I thought it'd be different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.02,1:01:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看来还是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's more of the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.70,1:02:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get going, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.11,1:02:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总卖给中情局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always sell to the CIA?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.98,1:02:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖给出价最高者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sell to the highest bidder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.28,1:02:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 等我回了约翰内斯堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you worry. When I get back to Joburg, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.55,1:02:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,避过了这阵风头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I lay low for a bit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.79,1:02:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你俩拿到工钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure both you guys get paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.62,1:02:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不担心钱的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I aingt worried about the money, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.08,1:02:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你拿得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you good for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.30,1:02:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去的路上 把我们丢在瓦坎达就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}On our way back, just drop us off in Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.05,1:02:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不想去那里 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to go there, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.30,1:02:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.40,1:02:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.67,1:02:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你们雌雄大盗的组合 今天就解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or your little Bonnie and Clyde routine ends today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.15,1:02:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your gun down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.81,1:02:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.56,1:02:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 埃里克 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, Erik. - It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.54,1:03:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想去瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to go to Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.39,1:03:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是野蛮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're savages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.03,1:03:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就这么对我们这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what they do to people like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.34,1:03:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不怕烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I aingt worried about no brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.83,1:03:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check these out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.50,1:03:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个都代表我杀的一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each one is for a kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.39,1:03:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么伤害自己无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can scar yourself as much as you'd like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.24,1:03:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们看来 你始终是个外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To them, you'll just be an outsider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.13,1:03:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是以为自己能走进去就是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy to think that you can walk in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.41,1:03:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还当你是个疯子美国人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To think I saw you as some crazy American.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.63,1:04:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.84,1:04:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务未能如愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your mission did not go as planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.59,1:04:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叔叔尼乔布究竟发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to my uncle N'Jobu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.91,1:04:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲说他失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father told me he disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.70,1:04:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a man today, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.25,1:04:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴了跟这枚一样的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}wearing a ring identical to this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.46,1:04:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.23,1:04:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮助了克劳逃脱 而且他戴了这枚戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped Klaue escape from us and he was wearing this ring!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.75,1:04:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爷爷的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather's ring!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.13,1:04:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我什么可能不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not tell me what is possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.77,1:04:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me the truth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.59,1:04:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some truths…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.03,1:04:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过沉重 特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are too much to bear, T'Challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.62,1:05:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是由你来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not your choice to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.01,1:05:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他究竟怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.03,1:05:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向国王保证过不会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised the king to say nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.57,1:05:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我是你的国王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'am your king now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.94,1:05:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叔叔接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your uncle took…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.74,1:05:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去美国做战士的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}A war dog assignment in America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.49,1:05:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.48,1:05:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我安插在了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Placed me there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.30,1:05:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,观察他\N{\fnArial\fs30}To observe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.70,1:05:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他并不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbeknownst to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.91,1:05:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叔叔爱上了个美国女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your uncle fell in love with an American woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.45,1:05:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们生了个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.06,1:05:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里看到的困苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hardships he saw there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.73,1:05:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他变得激进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radicalized your uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.02,1:05:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我袖手旁观了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I observed for as long as I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.37,1:05:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的领袖遭人暗杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their leaders have been assassinated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.29,1:06:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的社区被毒品和武器淹没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Communities flooded with drugs and weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.81,1:06:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们遭受警察暴力 执法过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are overly policed and incarcerated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.76,1:06:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All over the planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.48,1:06:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的同胞饱受苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}our people suffer because{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.79,1:06:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他们没有反抗的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't have the tools to fight back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.98,1:06:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有了振金武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}With vibranium weapons, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.24,1:06:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以推翻每一个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}they could overthrow every country, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.95,1:06:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达可以一统天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Wakanda could rule them all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.83,1:06:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好治理\N{\fnArial\fs30}the right way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.11,1:06:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你父亲绝不会答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew your father would not support this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.74,1:06:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你叔叔背叛了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your uncle betrayed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.27,1:06:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.09,1:06:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮助克劳盗取了振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped Klaue steal the vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.76,1:06:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.65,1:06:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要马上回国\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will return home at once…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.63,1:06:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,并面见议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you will face the council…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.47,1:06:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他们坦白你的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And inform them of your crimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.41,1:06:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他举起枪对准了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drew his weapon on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.53,1:06:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.91,1:07:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲杀了亲弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father killed his own brother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.72,1:07:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.52,1:07:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,决不许说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak nothing of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.04,1:07:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.24,1:07:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们丢下了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We left him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.15,1:07:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.58,1:07:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住\N{\fnArial\fs30}maintain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.38,1:07:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}the lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.12,1:08:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.02,1:08:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一份薄礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.89,1:08:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.75,1:09:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, where am l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.80,1:09:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么吓我 殖民者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't scare me like that, colonizer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.09,1:09:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我叫埃弗雷特\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? My name is Everett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.79,1:09:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 埃弗雷特·罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. Everett Ross…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.54,1:09:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,前空军飞行员 现中情局特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Former air force pilot and now CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.08,1:09:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.97,1:09:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这是瓦坎达吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, is this Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.47,1:09:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是堪萨斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's Kansas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.23,1:09:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩国是多久之前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long ago was Korea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.08,1:09:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.33,1:09:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.26,1:09:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪伤不会魔法般地一夜恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullet wounds don't just magically heal overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.93,1:09:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.36,1:09:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是靠魔法 是靠科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not by magic, by technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.72,1:10:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别碰 我哥哥很快就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything. My brother will return soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.93,1:10:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}These train things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.05,1:10:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是磁悬浮的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's magnetic levitation, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.94,1:10:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.17,1:10:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 但我从没见过这么高效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, but I've never seen it this efficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.88,1:10:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个灯板 是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The light panels, what are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.53,1:10:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 声波稳定器 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sonic stabilizers. - Sonic what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.31,1:10:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,未加工的振金太过危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}In its raw form vibranium is too dangerous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.26,1:10:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能高速运输\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be transported at that speed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.96,1:10:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我发明了一种办法让它暂时失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I developed a way to temporarily deactivate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.56,1:10:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些火车上是振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's vibranium on those trains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.21,1:11:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们周围到处是振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's vibranium all around us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.23,1:11:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是靠这个治好了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I healed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.76,1:11:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is T'Challa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.43,1:11:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵珠被关闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His kimoyo beads have been switched off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.60,1:11:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又不是连体婴 奥克耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we are not joined at the hip, Okoye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.96,1:11:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个男人出现在了边境 自称杀了克劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man showed up at the border who claims to have killed Klaue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.04,1:11:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.81,1:11:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦卡比此刻正在送他去王宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}W'Kabi is transporting him, as we speak, to the palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.36,1:11:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find your brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.65,1:11:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个外人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}An outsider?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.84,1:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, a Wakandan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.70,1:11:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a Wakandan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.71,1:11:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.03,1:11:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了亲弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed his own brother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.25,1:11:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还丢下了一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And left a child behind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.67,1:11:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}with nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.70,1:11:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of king…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.26,1:12:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的人会做出这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of man does that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.47,1:12:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,人无完人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man is perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.58,1:12:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.96,1:12:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都没好好安葬他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even give him a proper burial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.65,1:12:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叔叔尼乔布背叛了我们 但我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My uncle N'Jobu betrayed us, but my father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.28,1:12:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能制造了更可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may have created something even worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.56,1:12:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.83,1:12:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能让你父亲的错误决定你的为人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't let your father's mistakes define who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.47,1:12:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才能决定你要做怎样的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to decide what kind of king you are going to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.25,1:12:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥 你得马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, you need to get here now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.14,1:12:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克·斯蒂文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik Stevens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.68,1:12:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,19岁从安纳波利斯毕业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graduated Annapolis age 19…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.17,1:12:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在麻省理工学院攻读硕士\N{\fnArial\fs30}MIT for grad school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.33,1:12:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后加入海豹突击队 去了阿富汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joined the SEALs and went straight to Afghanistan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.52,1:12:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里杀人无数\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he wrapped up confirmed kills, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.22,1:12:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像在打电子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}like it was a video game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.88,1:12:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始有了杀人魔头的称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started calling him killmonger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.65,1:13:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他加入了一个联合特种作战司令部的秘密部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He joined a JSOC ghost unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.29,1:13:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now these guys are serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.70,1:13:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会隐藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will drop off the grid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.89,1:13:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行刺杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they can commit assassinations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.01,1:13:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,颠覆政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take down governments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.30,1:13:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有透露过他的身份吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he reveal anything about his identity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.04,1:13:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有战士纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a war dog tattoo, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.09,1:13:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们并无他的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have no record of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.05,1:13:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人到底是不是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this man Wakandan or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.50,1:13:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们究竟怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us what is going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.75,1:13:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.37,1:13:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.27,1:13:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来到了你的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standing in your house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.56,1:13:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,处决了一个 盗走你们振金 还杀了你们人的罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}serving justice to a man who stole your vibranium and murdered your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.12,1:13:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们国王没能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justice your king couldn't deliver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.11,1:14:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你是不是带来了克劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care that you brought Klaue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.93,1:14:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以没有就地杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only reason I don't kill you where you stand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.19,1:14:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我知道你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.50,1:14:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.71,1:14:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.94,1:14:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.69,1:14:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都安安稳稳地坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all sitting up here comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.59,1:14:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must feel good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.74,1:14:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界还有20亿跟我们一样黑皮肤的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about two billion people all over the world that looks like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.57,1:14:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们的生活要艰辛得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But their lives are a lot harder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.72,1:14:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达有解放他们所有人的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda has the tools to liberate 'em all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.07,1:14:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么工具呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what tools are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.98,1:14:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,振金 你们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium. Your weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.83,1:14:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的武器绝不会用来向世界发动战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our weapons will not be used to wage war on the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.64,1:14:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会去评判外人的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not our way to be judge, jury and executioner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.32,1:14:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,并决定赏罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}for people who are not our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.97,1:14:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.57,1:14:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但生命不是在这个大陆上诞生的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But didn't life start right here on this continent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.05,1:14:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么所有人不都该是你的同胞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So aingt all people your people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.63,1:15:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是所有人的国王 我是瓦坎达的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iam not king of all people. I am king of Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.23,1:15:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is my responsibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.26,1:15:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证人民的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make sure our people are safe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.42,1:15:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,并确保振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that vibranium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.94,1:15:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会落入你这种人手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}does not fall into the hands of a person like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.84,1:15:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.74,1:15:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已听够了这骗子的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have entertained this charlatan for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.46,1:15:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝他的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reject his request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.75,1:15:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没提出要求呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I aingt requesting nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.27,1:15:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问问我是谁 - 你是埃里克·斯蒂文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ask who I am. - You're Erik Stevens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.89,1:15:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国秘密特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}An American black operative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.05,1:15:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,绰号「杀人魔头」的佣兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mercenary nicknamed Killmonger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.85,1:15:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.01,1:15:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的名字 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my name, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.93,1:15:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我吧 国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me, king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.31,1:15:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.52,1:15:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.02,1:15:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.68,1:15:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.96,1:15:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫尼贾达卡 尼乔布王子的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am N'jadaka, son of prince N'Jobu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.33,1:15:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼乔布的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of N'Jobu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.58,1:15:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到我爸爸尸体上有豹爪印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found my daddy with panther claws in his chest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.95,1:15:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不是国王的儿子 你是杀人犯的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aingt the son of a king. You a son of a murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.97,1:15:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.37,1:15:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撒谎 - 恐怕不是 太后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lies! - I'm afraid not, queen mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.16,1:15:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.36,1:16:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼乔布的后人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The descendent of N'Jobu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.92,1:16:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯母好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, auntie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.78,1:16:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要行使我与生俱来的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm exercising my blood right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.76,1:16:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战国王的王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}to challenge for the mantles of king{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.96,1:16:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和黑豹的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}and black panther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.02,1:16:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做 特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not do this, T'Challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.36,1:16:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为尼乔布王子的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the son of prince N'Jobu, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.57,1:16:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有权利这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is within his rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.66,1:16:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里没有任何权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no rights here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.05,1:16:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战要准备数周\N{\fnArial\fs30}The challenge will take weeks to prepare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.53,1:16:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,数周 没那个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weeks? I don't need weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.63,1:16:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要全国都来 只要他来就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole country aingt gotta be there. I just need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.05,1:16:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要来个人给我解开镣铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somebody to get me outta these chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.31,1:16:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉 你知道此事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa, what do you know of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.38,1:16:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受你的挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept your challenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.86,1:17:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打不过特查拉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll never beat T'Challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.77,1:17:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就该第一次挑战时来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should've just come to the first challenge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.67,1:17:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,早点了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gotten it over with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.68,1:17:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king will now have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.10,1:17:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,将被剥去黑豹的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}the strength of the black panther stripped away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.71,1:17:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯特工呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Agent Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.56,1:17:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他关在办公室里了 他哪都去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I locked him in the office. He's not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.41,1:18:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最后的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.34,1:18:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw down your weapons, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.26,1:18:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以换个方式解决此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can handle this another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.18,1:18:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子都在为此刻做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived my entire life waiting for this moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.32,1:18:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我训练 撒谎 杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trained, I lied, I killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.45,1:18:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to get here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.85,1:18:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在美国杀人 在阿富汗杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed in America, Afghanistan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.26,1:18:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伊拉克杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iraq.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.49,1:18:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这个大陆上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took life from my own brothers and sisters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.68,1:18:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀过我自己的同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here on this continent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.70,1:18:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all this death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.45,1:18:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so I could kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.33,1:18:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the challenge begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.97,1:19:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.65,1:20:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作起来 特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snap out of it, T'Challa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.45,1:20:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.37,1:20:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.68,1:20:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.39,1:20:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.19,1:20:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祖厉 不 - 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zuri, no. - Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.50,1:20:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祖厉 - 祖厉 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zuri! - Zuri, don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.89,1:20:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我导致了你父亲的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the cause of your father's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.20,1:20:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.79,1:20:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.47,1:20:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩我都要杀 詹姆斯叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you both, uncle James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.54,1:20:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.71,1:20:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.88,1:20:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖厉 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zuri, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.12,1:20:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.45,1:20:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 祖厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Zuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.97,1:20:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.40,1:21:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.36,1:21:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们的国王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.83,1:21:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们的国王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.45,1:21:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.92,1:21:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还要带领你们进入未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's supposed to lead you into the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.05,1:21:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.78,1:21:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能做点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there nothing that can be done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.70,1:21:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.50,1:21:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要保护你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's supposed to protect you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.38,1:21:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.97,1:21:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.32,1:21:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才是你们的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. I'm your king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.00,1:21:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No! - We have to go now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.77,1:22:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,王太后 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen mother, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.54,1:22:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,王太后和苏睿 她们安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen mother and Shuri, they are safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.63,1:22:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.90,1:22:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.64,1:22:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得立刻去找她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get to them immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.48,1:22:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.25,1:22:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 虽然我的心与你们同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Though my heart is with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.86,1:22:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能把这个国家交给一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot turn over our nation to a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.15,1:22:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时前才到来的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who showed up here only hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.20,1:22:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是王室血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is of royal blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.29,1:22:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他杀了特查拉 - 那是仪式格斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He killed T'Challa! - In ritual combat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.78,1:22:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真的要紧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that really matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.21,1:23:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是瓦坎达最伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the greatest warrior Wakanda has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.55,1:23:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我推翻他 别让他羽翼丰满起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me overthrow him before he becomes too strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.62,1:23:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,推翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overthrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.57,1:23:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.21,1:23:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个可以自由来去的探子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a spy who can come and go as they so choose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.68,1:23:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要忠于王位 不管坐在上面的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am loyal to that throne, no matter who sits upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.82,1:23:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忠于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you loyal to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.93,1:23:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.86,1:23:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱我的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved my country, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.26,1:23:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就该效忠国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you serve your country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.45,1:23:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要救我的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I save my country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.69,1:23:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.07,1:23:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.68,1:23:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 除非你也想一起死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me, unless you want to join him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.70,1:24:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Baba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.60,1:24:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.02,1:24:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我们都不能安葬他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama, we didn't even get to bury him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.13,1:24:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我 - 娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's me. - Nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.17,1:24:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.21,1:24:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是特查拉的朋友 他救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a friend of T'Challa's. He saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.39,1:24:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克耶呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Okoye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.45,1:24:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye is not coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.69,1:24:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和女子皇家护卫队要效忠新王\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and the dora Milaje will serve the new king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.12,1:24:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.15,1:24:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的瓦坎达是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has happened to our Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.01,1:25:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让心形草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow the heart-shaped herb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.58,1:25:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,赋予你黑豹的神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give you the powers of the black panther, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.59,1:25:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,并带你进入先祖之域\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take you to the ancestral plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.67,1:26:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是叫你别乱翻我的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you about going into my things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.86,1:26:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you find?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.19,1:26:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.86,1:27:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了你钥匙 就是希望你有一日能见到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you a key hoping that you might see it someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.64,1:27:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.49,1:27:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有世上最美的日落\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sunsets there are the most beautiful in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.04,1:27:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但恐怕你还是不会受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I fear you still may not be welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.87,1:27:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.18,1:27:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会说你迷失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will say you are lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.32,1:27:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.04,1:27:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不为我流泪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tears for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.82,1:27:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.35,1:27:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的生活就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just life around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.57,1:27:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at what I have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.86,1:27:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该带你回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've taken you back long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.12,1:27:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果 我们都被抛弃在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, we are both abandoned here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.75,1:28:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你的家乡才迷失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe your home is the one that's lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.49,1:28:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们才找不到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they can't find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.60,1:28:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 呼吸 国王陛下 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe! Breathe, my king, breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.45,1:28:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe. Breathe. Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.67,1:28:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是心形草的效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart-shaped herb did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.34,1:28:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是全部的了吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This all of it? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.76,1:28:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样等再有下任国王时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when it comes time for another king, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.60,1:28:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有所准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.52,1:28:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,下任国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.80,1:28:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,全烧了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, go ahead and burn all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.82,1:28:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 我们不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king, we cannot do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.66,1:28:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is our tradition…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.44,1:29:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你做什么的话 我就不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I tell you to do something, I mean that shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.28,1:29:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,全烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn it all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.14,1:29:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, where I'm from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.35,1:29:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑人掀起革命时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when black folks started revolutions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.55,1:30:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有足够火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}they never had the firepower, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.47,1:30:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和资源去对抗压迫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the resources to fight their oppressors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.33,1:30:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候瓦坎达在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.04,1:30:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all that ends today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.03,1:30:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在全球每个国家都有探子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got spies embedded in every nation on earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.13,1:30:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already in place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.85,1:30:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道殖民者怎么思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how colonizers think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.72,1:30:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就用他们的策略对付他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna use their own strategy against 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.03,1:30:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把振金武器送去给我们的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna send vibranium weapons out to our war dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.17,1:30:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们把武器分给全世界的被压迫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll arm oppressed people all over the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.95,1:30:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们能起义 杀死当权者\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they can finally rise up and kill those in power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.67,1:30:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.92,1:30:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他与他们同流的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyone else who takes their side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.45,1:30:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该让他们知道我们真实的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time they know the truth about us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.86,1:30:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're warriors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.76,1:30:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界要大翻盘 这次 我们要占据上风\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's gonna start over, and this time, we're on top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.41,1:30:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达将成为日不落帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun will never set on the Wakandan empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.58,1:30:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达能延续至今\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda has survived for so long, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.27,1:30:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直是只在绝对必要时动武\N{\fnArial\fs30}by fighting when only absolutely necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.90,1:30:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达过去的确是如此行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda survived in the past this way, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.90,1:31:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但世界在改变 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the world is changing, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.87,1:31:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,长老们 世界越来越小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elders, it is getting smaller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.08,1:31:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的世界在追赶上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The outside world is catching up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.15,1:31:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 局面就会成为不去征服\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon it will be the conquerors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.32,1:31:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,便会被征服\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the conquered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.65,1:31:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可做前者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather be the former.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.66,1:31:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都听到命令了 我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard your orders. Let's get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.01,1:31:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where are we going again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.43,1:31:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要带心形草去贾巴里部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking the heart-shaped herb to Jabaril and.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.23,1:31:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,心形草 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart-shaped herb? What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.07,1:31:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,服用者能获得增强的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives whoever takes it heightened abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.59,1:31:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以特查拉才那么强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what made T'Challa so strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.86,1:31:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.06,1:31:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.72,1:31:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,心形草是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The herb belongs to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.98,1:31:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给姆巴库 可能会造就更大的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be creating a bigger monster with M'Baku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.46,1:31:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅 你该自己服下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia, you should take it yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.65,1:32:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个探子 还没有军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a spy with no army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.41,1:32:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝无机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't stand a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.07,1:32:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.99,1:32:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.76,1:32:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.09,1:32:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头 保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look down. Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.19,1:32:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.30,1:32:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.21,1:33:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.53,1:33:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在仪式格斗中被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}was murdered in ritual combat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.73,1:33:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 机会公平吗 - 是的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Were the odds fair? - Yes, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.71,1:33:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不是「被杀」 而是「被击败」\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was less a murder than a defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.68,1:33:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别戳我们的痛处 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do not rub our noses in it! - Silence!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.91,1:33:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 我才有权说话 小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make the pronouncements here, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.58,1:33:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下 新王是个美国…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, uh, your highness, the new king is a U.S…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.32,1:33:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,新王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new king…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.12,1:33:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot talk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.36,1:33:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再多说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more word, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.77,1:33:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就拿你喂我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will feed you to my children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.36,1:33:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的 我们吃素的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding. We are vegetarians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.81,1:33:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大猩猩姆巴库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great gorilla M'Baku…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.66,1:34:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是为此而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why we are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.56,1:34:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把它献给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To offer this to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.07,1:34:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个外人坐在了王位上\N{\fnArial\fs30}An outsider sits on our throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.02,1:34:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能帮我们阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you can help us stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.62,1:34:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.88,1:34:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.98,1:34:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he breathing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.08,1:34:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他陷入了昏迷 生命垂危\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in a coma. Barely clinging to life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.47,1:35:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的一个渔人发现了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our fishermen found him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.31,1:35:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂到了河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the edge of the river border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.06,1:35:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把他带来给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought him to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.46,1:35:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么把他放在雪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have him in the snow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.95,1:35:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一让他不会去见祖先的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the only thing keeping him from joining the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.83,1:35:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得送他去我的实验室 我在那里能治好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get him to my lab. I can heal him there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.33,1:35:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他走吧 不出几秒他就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him. He'll be dead in seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.77,1:35:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅 心形草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia, the herb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.30,1:35:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呼唤祖先\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call upon the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.70,1:35:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呼唤芭丝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call upon bast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.38,1:35:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟我儿子 特查拉在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here with my son, T'Challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.19,1:35:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,治好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heal him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.58,1:35:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把他埋起来 盖住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must bury him. Cover him. Cover him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.52,1:35:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.95,1:36:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,先祖保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.43,1:36:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,先祖保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.37,1:36:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,先祖保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.38,1:36:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先祖保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.92,1:36:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,先祖保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.44,1:36:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, T'Challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.38,1:36:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.08,1:36:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.80,1:36:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该回家来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time has come for you to come home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.01,1:36:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我团聚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be reunited with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.33,1:36:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.90,1:36:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不带那男孩回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you bring the boy home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.86,1:37:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Baba?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.99,1:37:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.33,1:37:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我选择无视的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the truth I chose to omit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.66,1:37:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该抛弃他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong to abandon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.39,1:37:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了我的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.27,1:37:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.95,1:37:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的未来需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our future depended…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.94,1:37:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.71,1:37:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you were wrong!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.96,1:37:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对外面的世界袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}To turn your backs on the rest of the world!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.77,1:37:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们因为害怕被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let the fear of our discovery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.31,1:37:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而没有做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop us from doing what is right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.85,1:37:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.87,1:37:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能留下陪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot stay here with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.41,1:37:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能安心地让他坐在王位上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot rest while he sits on the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.32,1:37:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们制造出来的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a monster of our own making.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.97,1:37:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须夺回王位 必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must take the mantle back. I must!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.38,1:38:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须纠正错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must right these wrongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.00,1:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有毯子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a blanket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.39,1:38:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人魔头有军队的完全支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killmonger has the full support of our military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.48,1:38:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.69,1:38:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还烧掉了心形草园\N{\fnArial\fs30}he burned the garden of the heart-shaped herb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.91,1:38:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.92,1:38:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他受的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he was trained to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.82,1:38:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的部队以前曾跟中情局合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}His unit used to work with the CIA{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.57,1:38:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,颠覆外国政权\N{\fnArial\fs30}to destabilize foreign countries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.74,1:38:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总在权力交接时出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would always strike at transitions of power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.00,1:38:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如大选之年 或是国王死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an election year, or the death of a monarch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.29,1:38:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制政府 军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get control of government, the military…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.91,1:38:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的资源 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our resources. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.09,1:38:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣山\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great mound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.05,1:38:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的振金 我的科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our vibranium, all of my designs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.22,1:38:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把我们的武器送去全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will send our weapons all over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.89,1:38:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须带她们安全离开瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must get them out of Wakanda safely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.25,1:38:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.52,1:39:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战还要继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}The challenge will have to continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.49,1:39:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉 我们不会离开瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa, we will not leave Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.09,1:39:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有责任保护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my duty to keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.12,1:39:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他拿到了我们的科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he gets control of our technology, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.92,1:39:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里都不会安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}nowhere will be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.85,1:39:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑豹不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.62,1:39:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到他为瓦坎达的命运而战时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he fights for the fate of Wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.80,1:39:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会伴他左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be right there beside him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.62,1:39:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As will I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.37,1:39:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.24,1:39:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你会需要全部的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're gonna need all the help you can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.63,1:39:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们煽情够了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.25,1:39:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.81,1:39:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让我和姆巴库大人单独谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you give me and lord M'Baku a moment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.46,1:40:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.28,1:40:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你个大人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owed you a great debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.37,1:40:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一命换一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A life for a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.12,1:40:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.27,1:40:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我母亲留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please allow my mother to stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.33,1:40:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会有事的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}No harm will come to her. I give you my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.33,1:40:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还挺需要支军队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I could use an army as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.26,1:40:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.96,1:40:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.83,1:40:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让贾巴里人为你的使命送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give no Jabari lives towards your cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.67,1:40:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is our cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.85,1:40:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是为了我们所有人 - 我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is for all of us. - Oh, us'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.39,1:40:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是几世纪来第一个屈尊到此的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us? You are the first king to come here in centuries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.85,1:40:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还说什么「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you speak of "Us"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.01,1:40:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法代表先王们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot speak for past kings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.31,1:40:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但此刻 有敌人坐在王座上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But an enemy sits on the throne right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.50,1:40:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚振金的威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know the power of vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.95,1:40:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果杀人魔头拿到了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Killmonger gains control of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.10,1:41:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他会来找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who do you think he will come for next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.75,1:41:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.07,1:41:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.76,1:41:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is on schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.12,1:41:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,探子都收到消息了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the spies been alerted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.32,1:41:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 有些人抗拒我们的新任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Some resistance to our new mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.11,1:41:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但伦敦 纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the war dogs in London, New York{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.79,1:41:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,和香港的战士都就绪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Hong Kong are standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.02,1:41:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先攻击那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll strike there first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.79,1:41:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人会想通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others will come around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.91,1:41:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.96,1:41:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,手持声波炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handheld Sonic Cannon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.26,1:41:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以抵挡一辆坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}powerful enough to stop a tank…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.07,1:42:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,金属探测器又探测不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untraceable by metal detectors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.93,1:42:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们有数千支\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we got thousands of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.16,1:42:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界会清楚地了解我们的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's gonna find out exactly who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.54,1:42:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.99,1:42:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼贾达卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}N'jadaka!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.88,1:42:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wassup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.44,1:42:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没认输呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never yielded!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.09,1:42:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了 我也没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as you can see, I am not dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.21,1:42:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that challenge shit is over with!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.23,1:42:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是国王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the king now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.69,1:43:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让飞机升空 继续任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those planes in the air! Carry out the mission!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.50,1:43:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏睿 动手 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shuri, now. - Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.13,1:43:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走 走啊 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go! Come on, Ross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.25,1:43:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦卡比 杀了这小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}W'Kabi, man, kill this clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.78,1:43:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦卡比 挑战还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}W'Kabi, the challenge is not complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.07,1:43:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.55,1:43:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,边境部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Border tribe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.87,1:43:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.94,1:43:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的心里满是仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heart is so full of hatred…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.34,1:43:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不配做国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not fit to be a king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.00,1:43:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来啊 - 阿由 去帮国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Ayo, the king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.31,1:44:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shields!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.56,1:44:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦卡比 停下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}W'Kabi, stop this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.12,1:44:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.84,1:45:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.94,1:45:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅和我会靠这个控制王室飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia and I will get control of the royal Talon with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.01,1:45:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.58,1:45:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得驾驶它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to fly it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.57,1:45:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你曾是优秀的飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You were a great pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.58,1:45:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我会教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll guide you through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.78,1:45:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像开飞行摩托一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like riding a hoverbike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.66,1:45:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你们还有飞行摩托吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You guys have hoverbikes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.51,1:45:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅 拿那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Nakia, take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.35,1:45:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是护卫队的 - 穿上吧 那是盔甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not a dora. - Just put it on, it's armor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.70,1:45:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.07,1:45:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 罗斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Agent Ross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.34,1:45:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know what I'm doing with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.34,1:45:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们指望你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're counting on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.01,1:46:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.38,1:46:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.02,1:46:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.13,1:46:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,遥控驾驶系统已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remote piloting system activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.91,1:46:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.06,1:46:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你弄成美国式的了 上去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it American style for you. Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.51,1:46:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.18,1:46:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.12,1:47:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 别让武器离开瓦坎达境内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! We can't let those weapons get beyond Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.73,1:47:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.90,1:47:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.76,1:47:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,压住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.69,1:47:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the necklace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.52,1:47:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the necklace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.20,1:47:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.04,1:47:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏睿 我看到它们了 怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Shuri. I got 'em. What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.48,1:47:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,击落啊 大天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot them down, genius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.41,1:47:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.15,1:47:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手一搏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.13,1:48:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,击落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, got them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.48,1:48:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.40,1:48:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, shit, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.39,1:48:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.90,1:49:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.42,1:49:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Princess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.91,1:49:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不会成为真正的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never be a true king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.99,1:49:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.11,1:49:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.99,1:49:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.63,1:49:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开底层的火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn on the train on the bottom track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.52,1:49:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳定器会让你的战服失效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stabilizers will deactivate your suit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.80,1:49:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没有保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't have protection!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.19,1:50:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither will he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.78,1:50:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.22,1:50:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要战服也能杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need a suit to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.50,1:50:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的统治结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reign is over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.93,1:50:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐在这里 安全无忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sat up here, safe and protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.73,1:50:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我们成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to see us become{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.12,1:50:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如此仇视的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like the people you hate so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.26,1:50:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他们那样逐个击破这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divide and conquer the land as they did!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.13,1:50:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是学习了我的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I learn from my enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.81,1:50:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们的游戏里打败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat them at they own game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.94,1:50:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经变成了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have become them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.41,1:50:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会毁灭这个世界 包括瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will destroy the world, Wakanda included!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.73,1:50:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界夺走了我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world took everything away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.87,1:50:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I ever loved!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.43,1:50:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会跟世界扯平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna make sure we're even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.84,1:50:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到每一个想要忠于你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna track down anyone who would even think about being loyal to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.97,1:50:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把他们埋进黄土之下跟祖厉做邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna put they ass in the dirt right next to Zuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.67,1:50:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.19,1:51:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 我没事 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - I'm okay. You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.18,1:51:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.01,1:51:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏睿 我甩掉了一个 但后面还追着俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri, I've lost one of them, but two are on my tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.17,1:51:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.04,1:51:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室遭受了袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lab is under attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.65,1:51:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.55,1:51:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,取消全息图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deactivating hologram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.55,1:51:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 你得快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross, you have to get out of there, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.08,1:51:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.05,1:51:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,玻璃完整性为50%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glass integrity is at 50%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.97,1:51:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.07,1:51:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross! Ross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.92,1:51:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrender now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.73,1:52:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们三秒放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have three seconds to lay down your weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.76,1:52:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.49,1:52:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.10,1:52:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲眼见证贾巴里的威力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness the might of the Jabari firsthand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.64,1:53:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,玻璃完整性为15%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glass integrity is at 15%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.72,1:53:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 武器严重失效 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Critical weapons failure. - Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.45,1:53:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏睿 最后一辆货运飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Shuri! The last cargo ship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.30,1:53:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要到边境了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is almost at the border…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.52,1:53:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们拿某种缆线困住了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they got me trapped with some kind of cables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.37,1:53:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,交叉胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make an x with your arms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.17,1:53:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,音波过载已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic overload initiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.55,1:53:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,展开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now break it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.55,1:53:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统正在重启 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}System rebooting in five…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.93,1:53:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four, three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.83,1:53:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.37,1:53:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统已重启\N{\fnArial\fs30}System rebooted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.62,1:54:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! We did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.30,1:54:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! Now get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.82,1:54:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.00,1:54:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.90,1:54:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会杀了我吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you kill me, my love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.31,1:54:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.02,1:54:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without question!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.78,1:55:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完蛋了 堂哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it for you, cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.05,1:55:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害的一招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.61,1:56:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pop said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.77,1:56:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达是他见过的最美的景色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda was the most beautiful thing he ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.70,1:56:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他答应过有一天会带我来见识见识\N{\fnArial\fs30}He promised he was gonna show it to me one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.91,1:56:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.46,1:56:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个奥克兰孩子 却相信一个童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid from Oakland, running around believing in fairy tales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.90,1:57:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好美啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.86,1:57:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们还能治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can still heal you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.68,1:57:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.79,1:57:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让你把我关起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can just lock me up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.15,1:57:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.32,1:58:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我葬在海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just bury me in the ocean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.58,1:58:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪伴那些为自由而跳船的先祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my ancestors that jumped from the ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.87,1:58:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们知道 为奴不如赴死\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause they knew death was better than bondage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.91,1:59:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.90,1:59:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.24,1:59:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.57,1:59:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our nation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.09,1:59:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to thank me for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.71,1:59:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的职责就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is our duty to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.92,1:59:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责就是为我所爱而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my duty to fight for what I love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.75,1:59:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.51,2:00:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能怪我 我差点就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't blame me, I almost died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.27,2:00:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.93,2:00:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道还有个办法能让你实现使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know a way you can still fulfill your calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.67,2:00:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.36,2:00:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他突破了 突破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he moves it! He moves it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.02,2:00:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那人是谁 - 篮下禁区\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who man is that? - Bucket!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.99,2:00:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.03,2:01:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要第一次带我来加州的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you said you would take me to California for the first time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.45,2:01:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是指去柯契拉音乐节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you meant Coachella…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.58,2:01:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是迪士尼乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Disneyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.73,2:01:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.27,2:01:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们父亲杀了叔叔的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where our father killed our uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.00,2:01:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要拆楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're tearing it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.85,2:01:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.97,2:01:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是要拆楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not tearing it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.23,2:01:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买下了这栋楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought this building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.87,2:01:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那栋楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.63,2:01:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那边那栋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that one over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.56,2:01:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里将成为第一座瓦坎达国际外联中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be the first Wakandan international outreach center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.54,2:01:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉雅负责社会交流工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia will oversee the social outreach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.01,2:01:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你领导科技信息交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will spearhead the science and information exchange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.20,2:01:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.97,2:02:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, what the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.30,2:02:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是布加迪宇宙飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like a Bugatti spaceship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.05,2:02:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 它凭空就冒出来了 你们看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, it came out of nowhere. Did y'all see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.84,2:02:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.03,2:02:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看看 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.01,2:02:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以坐这个回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take this back to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.52,2:02:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭它去学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up to school in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.63,2:02:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把它拆了卖掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can break it apart. We can sell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.96,2:02:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在易趣网上卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}On ebay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.79,2:02:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖价是一百万一个零部件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get, like, a million a piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.63,2:02:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不建议你们那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that if I were you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.49,2:02:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪来 - 瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you come from? - From Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.94,2:02:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is a Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.38,2:02:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.66,2:02:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.53,2:02:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.48,2:02:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.45,2:05:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是特查拉国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is King T'Challa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.90,2:05:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查卡国王之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of King T'Chaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.17,2:05:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是瓦坎达的最高统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the sovereign ruler of the nation of Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.47,2:05:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们史上第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the first time in our history…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.44,2:05:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,将与外界共享我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will be sharing our knowledge and resources…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.00,2:05:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,知识和资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the outside world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.98,2:05:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达将不再只从隐蔽处窥探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda will no longer watch from the shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.71,2:05:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.00,2:05:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能再如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.86,2:05:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会尽力成为榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will work to be an example{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.83,2:05:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让世人看到 地球上的人和国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}of how we as brothers and sisters on this earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.21,2:05:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,应亲如兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}should treat each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.37,2:06:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 甚于以往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, more than ever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.33,2:06:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,分裂的幻觉威胁着我们的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The illusions of division threaten our very existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.27,2:06:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.37,2:06:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的共同点多于不同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}More connects us than separates us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.91,2:06:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但面对危机时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in times of crisis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.75,2:06:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,智者建桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wise build Bridges{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.37,2:06:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚者筑墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the foolish build barriers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.54,2:06:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须想方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must find a way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.81,2:06:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此照应\N{\fnArial\fs30}to look after one another{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.42,2:06:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,团结一致 情同一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}as if we were one, single tribe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.87,2:06:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 国王特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, King T'Challa, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.96,2:06:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个农业国家能为世界提供什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what can a nation of farmers have to offer the rest of the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.67,2:13:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们又跟他玩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you playing around with that man again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.79,2:13:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 你们又在逗他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - You're teasing him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.10,2:13:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别吵醒他 让他休息 - 我没吵他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't wake him. He must rest. - No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.21,2:13:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.57,2:13:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔博 你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thabo, you're doing that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.03,2:13:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有 他撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's doing it. He's lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.68,2:13:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他在休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's resting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.74,2:13:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:50.16,2:13:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,白狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}White wolf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.86,2:13:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.18,2:13:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,白狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}White wolf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.62,2:13:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 巴恩斯中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Sergeant Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.86,2:14:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊我巴基就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.27,2:14:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.02,2:14:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.76,2:14:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.89,2:14:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.79,2:14:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有很多要学呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much more for you to learn.{\r}
